                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The shop owner, staff, and staff were all very friendly.\n\nThe food was delicious; the sweetness of the curry came entirely from vegetables and fruits,\n\nso sometimes the flavor might be slightly different 😂. You could definitely feel the care they put into the food.\n\nThey also had special latte sauce and pickled shallots,\n\nwhich added a wonderful aroma to the curry and made the texture even smoother—super cool!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "店狗和老闆、闆娘都很和善\n餐點也很好吃，咖哩的甜味全都用來自蔬菜水果\n所以有時候口味會有點不一樣😂\n完全可以感受到對餐點的用心\n還有特別的拿鐵醬和蕗蕎漬，\n加進咖哩裡面香香的，口感也更滑順，超酷的",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
