                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ2f2uZkSrQjQRQkyLoMW8d44/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRFltWkphV016TUVKNmRtNWpXRXRCUzFwME1IYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This curry rice \u0026 cafe combo is truly amazing!\n\nMy friend said their curry is cooked with the other ingredients, making the meat incredibly flavorful! The vegetable curry I had was also very generous with its toppings, and the special latte sauce added another layer of flavor. If you\u0027re still hungry, you can get more rice and sauce!\n\nSince it also has cafe service, I opted for tea since I can\u0027t have coffee in the evening, but look! Their tea was also exquisite and delicious!\n\nThe staff at the cafe are very friendly! You can even touch them!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "這家咖哩飯 x 咖啡廳真的令人驚艷！\n一起吃的朋友說他們的咖哩是跟著料一起煮的，所以肉超入味！我吃蔬菜咖哩的料也很豐富，還有特製的拿鐵醬可以淋上去又是另一層風味。吃不飽還可以加飯加醬好欸！\n畢竟還有咖啡廳的服務，晚上不能喝咖啡的我只好點個茶了但是你看！他們的茶也很精緻好喝！\n店裡的夠勾很親近人！可以摸摸！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
